# Used with: scripts/e2e.sh tests/e2e/search.actions -- target/debug/temzdf tests/fixtures/sample.pdf
# Expected: typing shows the prompt with incremental highlights (typing.png),
# Enter + n moves to the next hit (next.png), Esc clears highlights (cleared.png).
keys slash
type needle
pause 0.8
shot typing
keys Return n
pause 0.8
shot next
keys Escape
pause 0.5
shot cleared
